Package: looOmics
Type: Package
Title: Leave-One-Out Sensitivity Analysis for Omics Differential Models
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R: person("Tanay", "Belapurkar", email = "btanay041@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Performs sample-wise leave-one-out sensitivity analysis for
    differential models on high-dimensional omics data. Quantifies changes in
    feature-level coefficients, standard errors, statistical significance, and
    within-term feature rankings after individual samples are omitted; flags
    influential samples; and evaluates associations between influence and
    biological or technical sample metadata. Supports linear and generalized
    linear models, limma, and DESeq2, with optional Bioconductor data adapters
    and future-based parallel execution.
